<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL APPLIES FOR SHARE CONVERSION.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL APPLIES FOR SHARE CONVERSION.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's poultry enterprise Indykpol SA has applied for the conversion of 260,000 of its registered shares to common shares on August 1 this year, the company's management said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It also asked for the assimiliation of the shares with shares already trading on the bourse on August 4.</p>
<p>There are 970,000 shares of Indykpol currently in trading on the Warsaw bourse.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
